    <activityDescription>
      <activity id="3fee7455-be0a-514b-a6f8-26aef572d1d9" activityNameId="ba440ef4-9f54-5c33-9b03-1c6f7c087043" activityNameContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83" type="1" specialActivityType="0" energyValues="0">
        <activityName xml:lang="en">Pellets, iron, at plant</activityName>
        <generalComment>
          <text xml:lang="en" index="1">Full activity name: Pellets, iron, at plant
Inputs and air emissions from different sources. No transport of iron ore because pellets are fabricated at mine;
UUID: 2bbf8493-9ed1-3264-9e0f-aae60692082a
Blending, mixing and sintering. Emissions are abated
Location: Inputs relate to the global average. Emissions relate to European plants
Technology: Strate grate and grate kiln process
Time period: undefined
Production volume: 1.54E11 kg/a
Sampling: Main in- and outputs based on world average, emissions based on some plants in the EU. Everything based on literature. 
Extrapolations: see Geography
Uncertainty adjustments: none
BAFU mapped export: unsupported biosphere exchanges excluded; see audit/. Local UUIDs and generic activity classification are export conventions. Source: process_2bbf8493-9ed1-3264-9e0f-aae60692082a.xml</text>
        </generalComment>
      </activity>
      <geography geographyId="f4808887-5a57-5892-975e-ba0565a93e23" geographyContextId="f44c43c1-5cc5-54a6-ade6-24435bd12c83">
